ul space town, capture some beautiful screenshots, and enjoy the meditative flow of building among the stars.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/70851938eeaf13dfdc02dcffe202c957.poster.avif?t=1762102511\" width=606 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/70851938eeaf13dfdc02dcffe202c957.webm?t=1762102511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/70851938eeaf13dfdc02dcffe202c957.mp4?t=1762102511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE MODE - WEEKLY COMPETITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on new maps every week and compete with other players on the leaderboard. Experiment with different strategies, push your score higher, and enjoy a dose of friendly rivalry in short, replayable bursts.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/2b00875f8dd42ab81ad02a33c498e8ca.poster.avif?t=1762102511\" width=606 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/2b00875f8dd42ab81ad02a33c498e8ca.webm?t=1762102511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/2b00875f8dd42ab81ad02a33c498e8ca.mp4?t=1762102511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in AstroScaper is a unique, tiny world, each offering its own layout and challenge. Enjoy soothing, stylized cosmic scenery as you navigate randomly generated environments just waiting to be filled with your creations. Try different challenges based on shareable map seeds, and take part in community-driven shared challenges that keep the gameplay fresh and engaging.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AstroScaper is crafted by a two-person team. Inspired by minimalist city-builders like Islanders, it offers a similar pace and aesthetic while introducing new mechanics enabled by its sci-fi setting.<br>We\u2019re pouring our hearts into this little universe and welcome you along for the journey. Feel free to share feedback and ideas!</i></p>","developers":["Fun Fortress"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/3c88c1ad3513d2c7b2523352824f74d837773990/header.jpg?t=1762102511","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757094636","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757094636","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579350/176346011/e0d7cbe356c2a03251d4b7245a170737a09e6a86/1757092090/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757094636","id":257191047,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191047/movie480.mp4?t=1757094636","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191047/movie_max.mp4?t=1757094636"},"name":"AstroScaper Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191047/b4786740520417469828d10f681667c2dc3d5955/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757094636","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191047/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757094636","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191047/movie_max_